SYNTHETIC – unlicensed /metrics could not be observed (research R-10, S-5)
Hand-written fixture for GET /ibis/rest/metrics?format=json on a server without the metrics
license entry (tasks.md T052). The recorded nodes are all licensed, so the real answer is unknown. The
file is named .json after the requested format, but deliberately holds a non-JSON (HTML) body with
HTTP 403, the most likely shape. Decision R-10: any /metrics failure other than 401, 503, timeout
or unreachable (e.g. 402/403/404/500 or a non-JSON body) is reported as
unavailable {load, METRICS_NOT_LICENSED} with the HTTP status in the reason.
